  message: "Fixed + merged (selfh/dev 4c8a8f66c1, bundled with WI-kolal + WI-fumut). compact's default selection flipped from connectivity-aware to a GLOBAL centrality-ranked prefix (D12; spec 'Output reproducibility' already declared this the default). --no-connectivity replaced by --connectivity ('connected core') opt-in. 5 cli.py sites (2 flag defs, 2 wirings, run_behavior_map default True->False). Behavioral evidence: main() --connectivity routes both modes to valid compact output; 3467 affected tests pass; core 100%. Bakeoff-tagged (default compact output shape changes across the corpus). Wave-4 projection lynchpin."  # a955
