  message: "NO_MOVE (plurality) via DEEP bakeoff deep-20260623-134237 cohort-001 iter-004 (8 repos, code e5a019c2): 4 no_move (apollo/spring/sherpa/pretix), 2 moved (SwiftyJSON/zoxide), 2 inconclusive-leaning-connectivity (caddy/express). Compact SELECTS by centrality (nodes_summary coverage high on small repos) but its visible ORDERING is source-path/containment-grouped, and on repos with build-wrappers (spring mvnw/pom), generated (.d.ts), vendored JS (pretix pdf.worker/d3/vue) or entrypoint-tier nodes the ranking surfaces that noise ABOVE centrality-top real code (spring: mvnw:die over OwnerController deg29; sherpa: Main entrypoints over WaveReader deg29; pretix: 83 selected nodes hold 1.3% of total centrality). Shares a root cause with the seed-ranking item WI-batit (reproduces) + the compact-representation finding. Keeping tag."  # ced6
